1.6.0
~~~~~
- Socket classes are now C++ move-only types
- Retire SocketHandle class without replacement
- Network interface listing now lists all interfaces again
- Listing of all network interface addreses IPv4/6
- NetworkInterface getters do not throw any more
- Add type trait tests for all user facing sockets
- CMake flags for platform specific or optional features
- Build missing docs for utility functions

1.5.0
~~~~~
- IPv6 support for internet socket types
- Internal SockAddress container for addresses
- Use SOCK_CLOEXEC by default for all sockets
- Fix handling of externally closed socket errors
- Restructure and split library into src and includes
- Allow direct add_subdirectory() use via CMake
- CI build and tests run for GCC and CLang
- Generated docs now contain examples

1.4.0
~~~~~
- receiveAll() convience function for streams
- Set ReuseAddress for INET sockets
- Set NODELAY for TCP sockets
- Fix corner cases in timedConnect
- Major expansion of unit test coverage
- CAN socket tested via vcan interface
- Extended usage examples
- Proper CMake include path handling

1.3.0
~~~~~
- Add support for UnixStreamSocket
- Unix socket file ownership and cleanup
- Use Linux API directly for CAN frames
- Fix handling of SIGPIPE when sending
- Fix peerDisconnected flag not set on recieve
- Fix missing EINTR handling on some calls
- Improved error handling for poll
- Move-only semantics for SocketHandle
- Modern DNS resolution
- Modern CMake build

1.2.0
~~~~~
- Add support for CAN frames and sockets
- Set multicast interface for UDP sockets
- TCP connect() with timeout
- More socket utils and ifconfig exmaple
- Switch to C++17 and use std::string_view
- Updated CMake build system

1.1.5
~~~~~
- Fixed evaluation and usage of invalid socket handles
  Thanks to Rimack Zelnick <rick.mack@ig.com.br> for reporting
- Unify handling of unix socket paths
- Fixed copy & paste error in the build files

1.1.4
~~~~~
- Update SCTPSocket to fit new library interface
- Fix assignment of SocketHandle from temporaries

1.1.3
~~~~~
- Fix resetting of the peerDisconnected flag

1.1.2
~~~~~
- Adopt usage of cppunit together with ctest
- Rewrite tests for cppunit
- Fix missing call to close in some utility functions (SocketUtils)

1.1.1
~~~~~
- Add missing test in SCTP constructor
- Fix possible memory leak in SCTP error path
- Changed SCTP exception messages
- Minor documentation updates

1.1
~~~
- A lot documentation fixes
- Add doxygen mainpage
- Add usage examples
- Fix bug in disconnect()

